{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_035_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b21a8565e76bbf439904f8ac79ca44ce0b732437c81c498320e2020d4ca9b1d8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61d415a20e150db2614c0ae22045092ba4f2ba74bdce4c5b7d912ac1af4a933e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n今年也感谢你的巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f17c23679a98943132d233763509d4bb6de5b2b48709470a9be8169c2a6b057a",
      "text": "我会留在休息时间享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:250d34aeab923569f060d47d93a5e955bc082c6fcce252bff27bba310352a70f",
      "text": "希望能合您的口味",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0c3f4e62f956d6c4ba68a09b7c4c418610d920857a388cd3a9ef27a32ff923",
      "text": "能让您喜欢真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:278b53f0be691dcf8fd68eb6496767151a7aef2f20590bd7bf313761a202ecfb",
      "text": "既然是你的选定那就肯定不会错吧。\n去年的巧克力也是无可挑剔的美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84de192e80cd0d74c4bbab17d917da335c46178c75578fe72552a38806d4cd7c",
      "text": "那是自然的。毕竟是制作人\n费尽心思为我们准备的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0147848e07a7f1300f52532fbd456eaf6d4675781aff1403da1bd9194cd5ecd4",
      "text": "不难想象你定是考量了诸多因素\n才挑选出了这款巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8920b6b6fa13908d9bf47526c9f1d6907fd9cd8526b6a06967e9faee53ac9b5",
      "text": "因为在平日的工作中，我也时刻看在眼里你时刻为我们着想、\n体贴入微的模样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9562088ca1723037331824d04e164d5a7ec9895c8779f5db51e4eacbb016829c",
      "text": "为了报答这份恩情，我也打算在今后的工作中\n倾尽全力做出成果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5045dc8373f12766b3c8c5b94f2ec32ed70d10e5fc4d321c16355e49df8c9ea7",
      "text": "今后我也很期待道夫先生的大显身手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_035_23:5_01_035_23_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9af5cc13f0ecf68f372d4d79a701fc4606db0304bc0dcff5e6aaacce60344ef",
      "text": "嗯。今后也请多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
